# Per-stock PRICE slices (build_stock_slices.py). Built here only to test stock.html locally —
# in production they are force-pushed to the sf-data Pages repo, because every stock's slice
# changes every trading day and committing them would grow this repo ~40 MB a day.
# The FINANCIAL slices (docs/fin/) are the opposite case and ARE tracked: only the handful of
# companies that filed since the last build produce new blobs.
